  "verseCount": 53,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "22",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "1KI 22"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "22",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Omung'oosi Mikaya akaambila Ahabu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kumuleembe kwabao akari wa Isiraeli ne Shamu khu miiko kitaru. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu mwiiko kukhola khataru omwami Yehoshafati owa Yuda acha khubona omwami Ahabu owa Isiraeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahabu areeba bakholi bewe ali, “Mumanyile muli lukoba lwa Ramoti-kileati lukhoyeele lube lulwefwe mala efwe khwasila busa, mala se khwalubukula khukhwama khu mwami owa Shamu tawe?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne Ahabu areeba Yehoshafati ali, “Onyala wacha ne nase mwiie e Ramoti-kileati?” Yehoshafati akobosia ali, “Ese ndi nga ewe, babaandu base bali nga babowo, chifarasi chase chili nga chichowo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehoshafati aloma ali, “Khekhunyoe khureebe Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi nio.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nio Ahabu alaanga bang'oosi alala, embi chimia chine mala abareeba ali, “Nje nibwaakale Ramoti-kileati namwe tawe?” Bamukobosia bali, “Cha osibwaakale, sikila Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi alakhua bukhili.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne kakhali Yehoshafati areeba ali, “Omung'oosi se alikhoo ano okundi niye khunyala khwabirirakho khwareeba Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi tawe?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahabu amukobosia ali, “Aliio mulala oramire, bali niye khunyala khwareeba Mikaya okhwa Imura. Ne kakhali ese namubiila, sikila se ang'oolelanga kamalayi tawe, ne kakhali kamabi.” Yehoshafati amukobosia ali, “Okhaloma orio tawe.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nio Ahabu alaanga mulala khu bemeelesi be lichipi lio mwami mala amuboolela ali, “Ndeerere khangu Mikaya okhwa Imura.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nono Yehoshafati ne Ahabu baba bekhaale khu ndebe che bubwami, ne bafwarire chingubo che bubwami, abuundu niio baulila, a silibwa sia Samaria. Ne bang'oosi boosi baba balikho bang'oola ebweeni waabwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nio Sedekia okhwa Kenaana, mulala khu nibo, ekholela chinjika che bichuuma mala aloma ali, “Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi aloma ali, ‘Ne chinjika chino olapila Bashamu khukhwola nga ne obaulila elala.’ ” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne bang'oosi babaandi boosi bang'oola bario. Baloma bali, “Cha e Ramoti-kileati mala okhile. Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi alakhukhola obaule.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omurumwa owacha khureera Mikaya amuboolela ali, “Lola bang'oosi babaandi boosi bang'oolile bulayi khu mwami. Lekha lilomaloma liowo libe nga liliabwe.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne Mikaya akobosia ali, “Nga Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi ne amenyile mindali, nilio Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi amboolela lili nilio ndaloma.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nga ne acha ebweeni wo mwami Ahabu, omwami amureeba ali, “Mikaya, khunyala khwacha khwebwakaala Ramoti-kileati namwe tawe?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mikaya akobosia ali, “Cha wibwaakale mala okhile. Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi alakhukhola oule.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne kakhali areeba Ahabu ali, “Ndikhuboolela khukhwola khenga ndi umbolele bung'ali bwong'ene mu lisina lia Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.27.17"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Khub. 27.17",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.9.36"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mat. 9.36",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MRK.6.34"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mk. 6.34",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Mikaya akobosia ali, “Mboone Isiraeli yoosi yasalaniile khu bikulu nga kamakheese kakhali no mwaayi tawe. Ne Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi aloma ali, ‘Babaandu bano se bali no mwimeelesi tawe, lekha buli mulala ache engo wewe mu muleembe.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahabu aboolela Yehoshafati ali, “Ese se khuboolele ndi se anyala ang'oolela kamalayi tawe ne kakhali kamabi!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.6.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Isa. 6.1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JOB.1.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ayu. 1.6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Mikaya achiililila ali, “Nono rekeeresia elomo eya Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi: Naboone Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi ekhaale khu ndebe yeewe eye bubwami ne banamae bewe boosi bamwimileo a mukhono kumuseecha ne kumukhasi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi areeba ali, ‘Naanu onyala aombelesia Ahabu nio ache mala ererwe e Ramoti-kileati?’ Mulala aloma sisiindu silala, ne okundi aloma sisiindi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nio eroho ndala yecha yema ebweeni wa Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi yaloma eli, ‘Ese ndamuombelesia.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi akireeba ali, ‘Olamubea oriena?’ Eroho eyo yakobosia eli, ‘Ese ndacha mala mbe omubeeyi khubirira khu bang'oosi ba Ahabu boosi.’ Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi aloma ali, ‘Cha omuombelesie ne olaba ne bukhili. Cha mala okhole orio.’ ” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mikaya achiililila ali, “Nono Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi areere roho owe bubeeyi mu bang'oosi bowo bano boosi. Ne Wele aboolile kamabi khwiwe.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nio Omung'oosi Sedekia okhwa Kenaana acha khu Mikaya amupa luui mala amureeba ali, “Roho owa Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi acha ariena khukhwama khwise alomaloma ne nawe?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mikaya amukobosia ali, “Olimanya endaalo niio olicha khukhwikisa mu lusiro lwe akari.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne omwami Ahabu aloma ali, “Amba Mikaya mala mumukobosie khu Amoni, omwimeelesi owe lukoba ne khu Yoashi omusoleeli wo omwami. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mulome muli, ‘omwami aloma ali: Ra omundu yuno mu siboe mala mumulisie siakhulia sitiiti ne kameechi, khukhwola nga ne engobola mu muleembe.’ ” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mikaya aloma ali, “Kaaba bali okobola mu muleembe aba Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi se alomaloma khubirira khwise tawe.” Mala atasakho ali, “Ulila, enywe baandu mwesi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Lifwa lia Ahabu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nio omwami Ahabu owa Isiraeli no mwami Yehoshafati owa Yuda barekukha bacha e Ramoti-kileati. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahabu aboolela Yehoshafati ali, “Ese ndekosaasia fwaane omundu okundi nio nje mwiie. Ne ewe ifwara chingubo chowo che bubwami.” Nio omwami owa Isiraeli engila mwiie ne ekosiaasiisie. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omwami owa Shamu aba alakile banamae bewe kamakhumi kataru na babili be khu makaari ke liie ali, “Mukhebwaakalakho omundu yesi yesi tawe ne akhali omwami owa Isiraeli yeng'ene.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nio nga ne babona omwami Yehoshafati, boosi bebaasia bali ali omwami owa Isiraeli. Bayuukha bamwibwaakala. Yehoshafati alila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nga banamae kamakhumi kataru na babili abo bamanya bali se ali omwami owe Isiraeli tawe balekha khumutimania. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne kakhali omunamae mulala akhweesa buyiingo bwewe embi ne omwami owa Isiraeli mala amulasa akari we bubwongelo bwe chingubo chewe che liie. Omwami Ahabu aboolela owatimianga likaari liewe ali, “Yuukha, mala undusie mwiie sikila bandasile.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Liie liaba liamemee endaalo ng'ene eyo. Omwami Ahabu arama ne akalamiliile mu likaari liewe, aloleleele Bashamu. Oli yola akolooba afwa. Kamafuki khukhwama niio bamulasa keekha koola asi we likaari liewe lie liie. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oli enyanga echa khukwa, lilaka liarura liacha mu banamae ba Isiraeli lili, “buli mundu akobole mu lukoba lwewe ne mu sibala siewe.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.36"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nio omwami Ahabu afwa mala bamusuta bamureera e Samaria mala bamusiikha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basiinga likaari liewe mu litiisi lia Samaria, niio chimbwa chakhoomba kamafuki kewe mala bakhasi baeyani besiinga mu litiisi elio khuloondekhana ne elomo eya Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi niyo aloma. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nono bikholwa bibiindi bioosi nibio omwami Ahabu akhola, alala ne lichipi liewe lie kimisaanga, ne chingoba choosi nicho ombakha, biaandikwa mu sitabu sie chingano che Babaami ba Isiraeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nio Ahabu afwa mala Ahasia omusoleeli wewe amiia mu bweyaangu bwewe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.40"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yehoshafati omwami owa Yuda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehoshafati okhwa Asa arakikha khukhwaamiia Yuda mu mwiiko kwa khane kwe mu bwami bwa Ahabu omwami owa Isiraeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehoshafati aba bukhulu bwe kimiiko kamakhumi kataru ne kiraano nga arakikha khukhwaamiia. Amiia khukhwama Yerusalemu khu miiko kamakhumi kabili ne kiraano. Maayi wewe aba bali Asuba, omukhaana owa Shilihi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehoshafati akeenda mu ngila choosi cha raraawe. Se akaluukhanakho tawe. Akhola kali kamalayi ebweeni wa Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi. Ne kakhali se arusiao abuundu aesuta tawe. Babaandu bachiililila khuanilao chimbosio ne khukhwosielayo bibiindu biiunya bulayi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehoshafati yesi akhola kumuleembe no mwami owa Isiraeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.44"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nono bikholwa bioosi nibio Yehoshafati akhola, kamaani kewe niko okesia, ne kamae keewe niko apana, biaandikwa mu Sitabu sie chingano che Babaami ba Yuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enyosiao balaaya be siseecha boosi mu sibala babaramao khukhwama mu ndaalo cha raraawe Asa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.46"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sibala sia Edomu se siaba no mwami tawe. Siamiibwa no mwimeelesi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.47"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omwami Yehoshafati ombakha chimeeli che bubwofuli cheleele chiche e Ofiri khureera esahabu. Ne se chacha tawe sikila bibuli bie kameechi biachipila e Esioni-geberi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.48"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nio omwami Ahasia okhwa Ahabu aboolela Yehoshafati ali, “Lekha bakholi base bache mu meeli ne bakholi bowo.” Ne kakhali Yehoshafati se enya tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.49"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "50",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:50"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "50",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehoshafati afwa mala asiikhwa mu biliindwa bie bakuuka bewe mu Lukoba lwa Daudi. Ne Yehoramu omusoleeli wewe amiia mu bweyaangu bwewe.",
