        },
        {
          "text": "Ahasia okhwa Ahabu arakikha khukhwaamiia Isiraeli khukhwama Samaria mu mwiiko kwe ekhumi ne saba kwe bubwami bwa Yehoshafati, omwami owa Yuda. Amiia Samaria khu miiko kibili. ",
          "type": "text",
